# Woodwork Prodigy: "At the beginning of your upkeep, if this creature isn't prepared, it becomes prepared" (CR 603.4, 722.3a).
# Cast turn 1 (three Mox Rubies pay {2}{R/G}), it is not prepared until turn 3's upkeep, which puts a copy of Soul Tether in
# exile. Casting the copy (CR 722.3c) unprepares it and takes the copy with it; it makes a Heartwood token. Turn 5's upkeep
# prepares it again, a new copy of Soul Tether.

